every 60,000 ev kms motor oil will be changed
so basically its maintenance cost is less than any other car in this segment. | The first oil change at ~5,000 miles is mainly to flush out metal particles and residues from the engine break-in phase. After that, the engine runs cleaner and hybrid systems put less stress on the engine, so oil lasts much longer. That’s why the interval increases. it’s not the same condition anymore.

