 @ShelDockToyotaVitz | You would need to do a battery test to check its current level. If its weak then it is a possibility that this is a contributing factor. Remember that a dirty throttle body can also cause the problem. Also your EGR valve can be part of the problem so you can check these one by one until you fix the problem. Any mechanic you use would go through these the same.
